      "core_meaning_cn": "围绕“达成一致/给予认可”展开：名词是和谐或协定；动词可表示相符，也可正式给予",
      "core_meaning_en": "centered on agreement or recognition: harmony/treaty as a noun, agreement or formal granting as a verb",
      "mental_model_cn": "把四个高频骨架分开：in accord with = 与…一致；of one's own accord = 自愿；accord with = 相符；accord sth to sb = 正式给予。",
      "mental_model_en": "Keep the four frames distinct: in accord with, of one's own accord, accord with, and accord something to someone."
    },
